cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "SetGRPO: Calibrating Grader-Induced Policy Optimization"
abstract: >-
  Set-Valued Group Relative Policy Optimization (SetGRPO) keeps the original GRPO
  objective and calibrates the within-group training coefficients as a joint
  uncertainty set, recovers the largest direction-safe update under the current
  policy geometry, and gates retained response groups with finite-sample risk
  control.
